# tally 2.2.1 P50 B1 (E §11): REQ-CLOCK is judged on the asks load left standing, with one file too:
# an ask refused alone prints its line, the rest answers (review g4 findings/b1/m). Before W13: REQ-CLOCK.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
input one: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  one = 1

ask q: one
ask p_gone: one in gone as known (2027-01-04)
=== expect
p_gone: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO ask p_gone names gone, neither the model nor a loaded scenario (m.tally:17)
q: 1
  cut 2026-04-30
